Whoops, that's a potato.

1303
01:19:34,010 --> 01:19:34,890
That's not an apple.

1304
01:19:35,170 --> 01:19:35,590
Whoops, sorry.

1305
01:19:35,910 --> 01:19:36,210
One sec.

1306
