Hold on, hold on, I'm not ready, I'm not ready.

1311
01:20:02,780 --> 01:20:04,960
Okay, stay there, stay there, stay there.

1312
01:20:06,860 --> 01:20:07,760
No, no, no, no, no, no.

1313
01:20:09,480 --> 01:20:10,920
Don't you dare shoot me up here.

1314
