1316
01:20:21,160 --> 01:20:21,720
He took it!

1317
01:20:34,670 --> 01:20:35,510
Do something!

1318
01:20:36,830 --> 01:20:37,490
Eat it!

1319
01:20:41,450 --> 01:20:42,190
Hold on.

1320
01:20:43,050 --> 01:20:44,110
