1322
01:20:57,240 --> 01:20:58,780
Remember last time I did this?

1323
01:20:59,120 --> 01:21:01,360
He was shaking when I gave it to him.

1324
01:21:02,120 --> 01:21:06,300
But I honestly don't remember if I threw it to him or if I right-clicked the apple on him.

1325
01:21:07,420 --> 01:21:08,520
I think I threw it.

1326
01:21:09,120 --> 01:21:12,480
Because remember, I opened the gates on him so I could get it in there.

1327
01:21:15,300 --> 01:21:16,860
You mind giving me that back, sir?

1328
01:21:18,440 --> 01:21:19,300
I need that apple.

1329
01:21:24,380 --> 01:21:24,860
Sorry!

1330
01:21:26,380 --> 01:21:27,180
I need it.

1331
01:21:27,500 --> 01:21:28,400
Some other time, then.

1332
01:21:30,620 --> 01:21:31,520
Good enough for me.

1333
01:21:31,880 --> 01:21:32,840
Let's keep exploring.

1334
01:21:34,980 --> 01:21:37,780
I really need some kind of keybind here, like this.

1335
01:21:42,830 --> 01:21:44,430
I'm so good at that.

1336
01:21:45,290 --> 01:21:47,470
Haven't fucked that up once, by the way.

1337
01:21:48,150 --> 01:21:49,130
Not once.

1338
01:21:50,450 --> 01:21:51,650
Perfect record.

1339
01:21:51,890 --> 01:21:52,810
