1340
01:21:55,050 --> 01:21:55,870
Not bad.

1341
01:22:00,270 --> 01:22:01,070
Nobody saw that!

1342
01:22:02,570 --> 01:22:03,050
Ow!

1343
01:22:03,390 --> 01:22:03,570
What?

1344
01:22:05,650 --> 01:22:06,650
God damn it.

1345
01:22:07,810 --> 01:22:09,830
