1346
01:22:10,790 --> 01:22:11,470
Classic me.

1347
01:22:12,290 --> 01:22:14,250
By the way, that was a lot of diamonds just now.

1348
01:22:14,430 --> 01:22:15,610
That was a good hole.

1349
01:22:16,890 --> 01:22:18,190
That was really nice.

1350
01:22:21,230 --> 01:22:23,250
Man, I want infinite night vision.

1351
01:22:24,230 --> 01:22:25,630
