02:17:47,500 --> 02:17:47,740
Done.

2167
02:17:48,080 --> 02:17:48,440
Okay.

2168
02:17:49,580 --> 02:17:50,640
What else do I need?

2169
02:17:51,000 --> 02:17:51,700
Ascension blocks.

2170
02:17:54,440 --> 02:17:55,000
Done.

2171
02:17:55,930 --> 02:17:56,690
And that's about it.

2172
02:17:57,410 --> 02:17:58,030
I think I'm good.

2173
02:17:58,250 --> 02:17:58,870
I'm ready to go.

2174
02:18:04,570 --> 02:18:05,250
That was amazing.

2175
02:18:07,790 --> 02:18:08,590
I needed one more thing.

2176
02:18:08,730 --> 02:18:08,830
Right.

2177
02:18:09,330 --> 02:18:09,870
Put that in there.

2178
02:18:16,650 --> 02:18:17,570
Much better.

2179
02:18:17,870 --> 02:18:19,790
Now I feel more confident.

2180
02:18:21,030 --> 02:18:21,750
Okay.

2181
02:18:22,670 --> 02:18:24,170
We went west.

2182
02:18:24,170 --> 02:18:25,750
This should be an easy recovery.

2183
02:18:26,490 --> 02:18:27,990
Oh, boat and bed.

2184
02:18:30,090 --> 02:18:32,270
I can't forget essentials here.

2185
02:18:33,930 --> 02:18:35,950
Boat and a bed.

2186
02:18:37,610 --> 02:18:39,050
I'm gonna take this bed up here.

2187
02:18:43,030 --> 02:18:43,630
Thank you.

2188
02:18:44,110 --> 02:18:45,810
Although, this is one of my favorite beds.

2189
02:18:45,930 --> 02:18:46,250
It's red.

2190
02:18:46,770 --> 02:18:47,770
It's kind of a rarity.

2191
02:18:48,310 --> 02:18:48,830
You know?

2192
02:18:49,570 --> 02:18:50,790
I would say that bed is rare.

2193
02:18:54,910 --> 02:18:55,650
Okay, guys.

2194
02:18:55,870 --> 02:18:56,310
I'm off.

2195
02:18:56,810 --> 02:18:58,090
Don't do anything I wouldn't.

2196
02:18:58,890 --> 02:18:59,590
See you later.

2197
02:19:00,310 --> 02:19:01,490
I have the basics.

2198
02:19:02,410 --> 02:19:03,270
It's time to rock.

2199
02:19:08,460 --> 02:19:22,900
The only problem is... I found that biome by flying, so it is possible I will not be able to get the same sort of view when I come at it with a boat.

2200
02:19:25,140 --> 02:19:26,000
That's the problem.

2201
02:19:28,920 --> 02:19:29,680
But it should be fine.

2202
02:19:30,200 --> 02:19:31,680
We're gonna play it ultra safe, you know.

2203
02:19:32,080 --> 02:19:34,560
We're gonna sleep as soon as Knight's about to hit, all that stuff.

2204
02:19:37,180 --> 02:19:38,220
And this is the way we went.

2205
02:19:41,240 --> 02:19:43,460
Chances are we did not go in a perfectly straight line.

2206
02:19:46,440 --> 02:19:48,040
So we gotta look for landmarks.

2207
02:19:50,300 --> 02:19:53,920
The place we died, by the way, had lots and lots of mountains.

2208
02:19:54,820 --> 02:19:55,780
That's what I remember.

2209
02:19:56,380 --> 02:19:57,980
Big mountains and lots of them.

2210
02:19:58,260 --> 02:20:00,140
And a lot of the mountains had snow on them.

2211
02:20:03,240 --> 02:20:04,580
That's also an important indicator.

2212
02:20:04,660 --> 02:20:05,800
I did not bring my compass.

2213
02:20:07,600 --> 02:20:09,000
That is a huge blunder.

2214
02:20:09,920 --> 02:20:10,720
It's fine, though.

2215
02:20:10,820 --> 02:20:11,980
I know where Wes is.

2216
02:20:12,600 --> 02:20:13,820
We have the sun for that.

2217
02:20:18,700 --> 02:20:19,900
Yeah, I'm totally confident.

2218
02:20:20,020 --> 02:20:21,180
Or I'm gonna get everything back, it's fine.

2219
02:20:21,540 --> 02:20:25,140
Also, I didn't die near anything like lava, so my items should still be there.

2220
02:20:25,240 --> 02:20:26,800
Everything is a-okay.

2221
02:20:29,000 --> 02:20:29,440
Yeah.

2222
02:20:31,300 --> 02:20:33,080
We're just gonna enjoy this boat right now.

2223
02:20:33,880 --> 02:20:35,640
And feed some dirt to the fishies.

2224
02:20:38,680 --> 02:20:42,440
I still can't believe you can mouse over and press Q on items.

2225
02:20:43,620 --> 02:20:44,020
Insanity.

2226
02:20:45,000 --> 02:20:47,360
That makes it so much easier than dragging out and clicking.

2227
02:20:49,120 --> 02:20:49,840
Bro, I wonder.

2228
02:20:51,760 --> 02:20:54,720
Oh, I thought maybe Shift-Q would dispose the whole stack.

2229
02:20:55,800 --> 02:20:56,660
Not the case, though.

2230
02:20:58,360 --> 02:21:00,160
But I could, like, hold down Q, right?

2231
02:21:02,140 --> 02:21:03,180
Yeah, that works.

2232
02:21:03,540 --> 02:21:06,140
So I can just sort of hold down Q in my inventory when I want to throw things away.

2233
02:21:06,360 --> 02:21:08,120
Dude, that's a huge discovery, actually.

2234
02:21:10,260 --> 02:21:14,400
It would have saved me so much time throughout the years, I can say at this point.

2235
02:21:16,140 --> 02:21:17,540
Or a year, more like.

2236
02:21:19,800 --> 02:21:20,700
Don't get distracted.

2237
02:21:20,980 --> 02:21:22,840
So there's a village right over here we need to pass.

2238
02:21:24,660 --> 02:21:30,060
At some point, we're going to come across the tower on the left with the portal next to it.

2239
02:21:30,570 --> 02:21:32,290
At that point, we keep going west.

2240
02:21:45,770 --> 02:21:46,790
No, no, no.

2241
02:21:46,890 --> 02:21:47,830
Don't get distracted.

2242
02:21:49,590 --> 02:21:50,910
This is where I was flying.

2243
02:21:51,310 --> 02:21:52,710
I flew across here.

2244
02:21:58,080 --> 02:22:03,340
Of course, it's harder to recognize it because we're now from the very bottom.

2245
02:22:04,840 --> 02:22:06,160
We don't have the aerial view.

2246
02:22:07,100 --> 02:22:08,160
I remember that portal.

2247
02:22:08,240 --> 02:22:09,360
There's another portal right over here.

2248
02:22:09,580 --> 02:22:13,920
That is the portal I tried to enter and I was promptly confused and I kept going.

2249
02:22:16,710 --> 02:22:23,590
And then we are going to come across the... the sibling portals.

2250
02:22:24,630 --> 02:22:25,710
Siblings from hell.

2251
02:22:27,590 --> 02:22:29,010
Actually the worst time ever.

2252
02:22:31,950 --> 02:22:32,870
Time to walk.

2253
02:22:40,670 --> 02:22:42,430
To be honest, though, nice day out here.

2254
02:22:42,830 --> 02:22:43,310
Can't complain.

2255
02:22:43,470 --> 02:22:52,170
Also, in real life, today I went to the store without my big winter jacket on or scarf or mittens or anything like that.

2256
02:22:52,370 --> 02:22:54,690
It was just like a little sweater, you know?

2257
02:22:55,230 --> 02:22:56,310
And it was totally fine.

2258
02:22:57,510 --> 02:22:59,110
I felt so good in that moment.

2259
02:22:59,290 --> 02:23:00,250
I can't even tell you.

2260
02:23:00,830 --> 02:23:04,450
Having the sunshine on my cheeks like that was super nice.

2261
02:23:05,110 --> 02:23:08,510
Of course, I had to pull up my pants afterwards because people didn't want to look at that.

2262
02:23:08,670 --> 02:23:09,030
But, you know.

2263
02:23:10,060 --> 02:23:10,800
Just saying.

2264
02:23:14,360 --> 02:23:20,020
Definitely a nice thing compared to something a little different than it happened to me recently.

2265
02:23:20,680 --> 02:23:22,160
So I went on a date, right?

2266
02:23:23,220 --> 02:23:24,580
And she was really cute, all that.

2267
02:23:24,660 --> 02:23:25,640
We had great conversation.

2268
02:23:26,460 --> 02:23:28,100
I made a ton of jokes.

2269
02:23:28,600 --> 02:23:29,860
I made her laugh, all that.

2270
02:23:29,880 --> 02:23:30,520
It was great, you know?

2271
02:23:30,560 --> 02:23:31,200
We had a great time.

2272
02:23:31,640 --> 02:23:32,660
We kissed at the end.

2273
02:23:32,820 --> 02:23:33,680
It was great, you know?

2274
02:23:34,020 --> 02:23:35,260
Fucking sunset, all that shit.

2275
02:23:36,480 --> 02:23:39,080
And a couple days later... So I wrote after that day.

2276
02:23:39,220 --> 02:23:40,580
I was like, had a great time, you know?

2277
02:23:40,880 --> 02:23:41,700
Want to go on a second date?

2278
02:23:42,620 --> 02:23:44,120
And I've just been ghosted ever since.

2279
02:23:45,520 --> 02:23:46,280
So I don't know.

2280
02:23:47,440 --> 02:23:48,680
That felt terrible, man.

2281
02:23:48,880 --> 02:23:49,880
But it is what it is.

2282
02:23:50,660 --> 02:23:52,440
I still had a good time that night.

2283
02:23:53,160 --> 02:23:54,160
Nothing can change that.

2284
02:23:56,040 --> 02:23:58,560
But I have a feeling the sun coming out today, you know?

2285
02:23:58,920 --> 02:23:59,900
That was a good feeling.

2286
02:24:00,180 --> 02:24:01,800
That really changed my mind on things.

2287
02:24:03,160 --> 02:24:05,720
Here are the si... siblings.

2288
02:24:06,100 --> 02:24:07,660
Why is this portal sort of embedded?

2289
02:24:09,020 --> 02:24:09,600
Hold on.

2290
02:24:11,150 --> 02:24:11,810
Is that a bug?

2291
02:24:17,950 --> 02:24:18,610
It's not a bug.

2292
02:24:18,750 --> 02:24:19,910
I just made it into the ground.

2293
02:24:20,670 --> 02:24:22,070
I gotta sleep right now.

2294
02:24:24,490 --> 02:24:28,150
I am not equipped for combat and I'm not afraid to admit it.

2295
02:24:28,990 --> 02:24:29,530
There it is.

2296
02:24:41,290 --> 02:24:42,390
Okay, so we're on track.

2297
02:24:42,710 --> 02:24:43,490
That's the good news.

2298
02:24:47,250 --> 02:24:48,410
Oh, you piece of shit.

2299
02:24:51,030 --> 02:24:51,990
Don't mess with me.

2300
02:24:56,630 --> 02:25:02,610
So I'm pretty sure I went sort of, not directly west, but a little to the left while flying here.

2301
02:25:04,730 --> 02:25:07,970
Now, you may call me crazy, but I do remember that.

2302
02:25:13,980 --> 02:25:14,740
Go this way.

2303
02:25:20,400 --> 02:25:22,960
Now I could actually kill some horses.

2304
02:25:25,020 --> 02:25:26,080
That would be nice.

2305
02:25:26,820 --> 02:25:32,820
I'm scared of going through forests because that limits my visibility and I won't be able to see landmarks and check where I am.

2306
02:25:36,070 --> 02:25:37,250
Don't go too much to the left.

2307
02:25:37,510 --> 02:25:38,090
Trust it.

2308
02:25:38,310 --> 02:25:38,710
Just trust.

2309
02:25:38,930 --> 02:25:39,650
We keep going west.

2310
02:25:40,310 --> 02:25:42,710
At some point, we're going to emerge outside the forest.

2311
02:25:42,810 --> 02:25:43,090
It's fine.

2312
02:25:52,260 --> 02:25:53,880
Okay, I'm actually going to kill these.

2313
02:25:54,780 --> 02:25:55,800
I need the food.

2314
02:25:55,800 --> 02:25:56,860
I'm sorry, piggies.

2315
02:25:57,220 --> 02:25:59,340
I require sustenance.

2316
02:26:01,780 --> 02:26:06,740
Speaking of sustenance, a favorite word of mine recently is actually enunciate.

2317
02:26:07,520 --> 02:26:09,420
I love saying enunciate.

2318
02:26:09,760 --> 02:26:12,840
Because you really have to enunciate it when you say it, you know?

2319
02:26:13,220 --> 02:26:15,700
And it also... it just flows off the tongue so nicely.

2320
02:26:16,680 --> 02:26:17,500
Great word.

2321
02:26:17,780 --> 02:26:18,640
Love that word.

2322
02:26:19,760 --> 02:26:20,720
In fact...

2323
02:26:20,750 --> 02:26:22,310
Probably the greatest word ever written.

2324
02:26:24,050 --> 02:26:24,890
What am I doing?

2325
02:26:25,170 --> 02:26:25,490
Boat.

2326
02:26:28,650 --> 02:26:29,490
In here.

2327
02:26:31,210 --> 02:26:33,370
Another word I really like is municipality.

2328
02:26:34,790 --> 02:26:35,810
That's a great word.

2329
02:26:37,990 --> 02:26:38,510
Municipality.

2330
02:26:38,890 --> 02:26:40,410
I may be saying that wrong, actually.

2331
02:26:50,060 --> 02:26:50,460
Shit.

2332
02:26:50,460 --> 02:26:52,360
I do not remember this water.

2333
02:26:52,660 --> 02:26:54,640
I definitely need to go sort of that way now.

2334
02:26:55,500 --> 02:26:58,320
I can't... Especially... I need to see the tower at some point.

2335
02:27:00,040 --> 02:27:00,600
Tower... Okay.

2336
02:27:00,800 --> 02:27:02,220
Let's go this way for a little bit.

2337
02:27:05,080 --> 02:27:09,840
But let's be aware that we're going this way in case we get completely lost and we need to go... Wait.

2338
02:27:10,740 --> 02:27:11,660
West, south.

2339
02:27:11,820 --> 02:27:13,620
Then we need to go north again to get back on track.

2340
02:27:13,800 --> 02:27:13,900
Yeah.

2341
02:27:15,120 --> 02:27:15,880
That's the plan.

2342
02:27:19,180 --> 02:27:19,860
Jump here.

2343
02:27:26,720 --> 02:27:27,400
Oh, hey, Bee.

2344
02:27:31,700 --> 02:27:34,800
Okay, this is... no, no, no, this is definitely recognizable.

2345
02:27:35,060 --> 02:27:36,140
I remember that river over there.

2346
02:27:36,740 --> 02:27:37,380
We're on track!

2347
02:27:38,200 --> 02:27:39,200
Good news, everybody.

2348
02:27:44,180 --> 02:27:49,180
By the way, the lesson I learned from my death is that always make an EDP.

2349
02:27:49,420 --> 02:27:50,460
Don't even question it.

2350
02:27:50,660 --> 02:27:51,780
Just do it.

2351
02:27:52,800 --> 02:27:53,580
Don't be a hero.

2352
02:27:55,360 --> 02:27:56,340
Make the damn EDP.

2353
02:27:57,660 --> 02:27:59,800
I came up with that for a reason, right?

2354
02:27:59,940 --> 02:28:00,520
It works.

2355
02:28:01,760 --> 02:28:02,640
Don't be dumb about it.

2356
02:28:02,720 --> 02:28:03,680
In fact, I'm going to grab some of this.

2357
02:28:06,100 --> 02:28:09,720
We can turn it into paper on the fly here so that we can fly.

2358
02:28:10,500 --> 02:28:16,860
When we finally gather our items and actually have some gunpowder on us, we can make rockets on the fly.

2359
02:28:18,240 --> 02:28:19,260
Not a bad idea.

2360
02:28:22,400 --> 02:28:23,680
So I flew across here.

2361
02:28:23,780 --> 02:28:25,140
I'm pretty sure I flew that way.

2362
02:28:27,440 --> 02:28:29,280
So I'm just gonna have to follow the river here.

2363
02:28:29,340 --> 02:28:30,020
I'm taking more of this.

2364
02:28:40,720 --> 02:28:41,580
And we are going for it.

2365
02:29:01,090 --> 02:29:02,650
Do I remember this?

2366
02:29:04,290 --> 02:29:04,770
Yes.

2367
02:29:07,670 --> 02:29:10,610
Land of a thousand lakes is what this is.

2368
02:29:10,830 --> 02:29:12,150
This is pretty much Finland right now.

2369
02:29:12,590 --> 02:29:13,590
We're in Finland.

2370
02:29:17,910 --> 02:29:18,570
This way.

2371
02:29:21,050 --> 02:29:23,710
And I would definitely just have flown across here, I believe.

2372
02:29:24,550 --> 02:29:25,590
That is so me.

2373
02:29:25,870 --> 02:29:27,010
I would have done that.

2374
02:29:34,550 --> 02:29:39,670
Then again... Let me quickly scope out the area.

2375
02:29:53,870 --> 02:29:54,790
Take me out of here!

2376
02:29:55,310 --> 02:29:56,410
Get me out of here!

2377
02:29:58,390 --> 02:30:00,010
Guys, I feel like I'm going the wrong way.

2378
02:30:02,230 --> 02:30:04,090
I don't recognize a lot of this.

2379
02:30:06,590 --> 02:30:09,030
Let me go a little bit left, and then we keep going west.

2380
02:30:10,530 --> 02:30:11,830
When I say west, I mean south.

2381
02:30:12,550 --> 02:30:14,090
I mean, when I mean left, I mean south.

2382
02:30:14,230 --> 02:30:16,070
Not when I say west, I mean north in the south.

2383
02:30:17,700 --> 02:30:19,800
In that case, it would have been east, because it's opposite, right?

2384
02:30:19,900 --> 02:30:20,900
But we're actually going west.

2385
02:30:21,520 --> 02:30:25,900
Right now, I'm going south, only to go west later, even though it's actually to the right.

2386
02:30:26,400 --> 02:30:31,220
But don't confuse right with left, because that's bad.

2387
02:30:33,860 --> 02:30:34,860
I'm just going to stop talking.

2388
02:30:41,160 --> 02:30:42,360
Fuck, I don't recognize anything.

2389
02:30:46,770 --> 02:30:47,250
Wait.

2390
02:30:47,770 --> 02:30:48,850
What the fuck?

2391
02:30:49,190 --> 02:30:51,490
Why was I able to throw that egg so far?

2392
02:30:52,210 --> 02:30:53,270
The hell is that?

2393
02:30:54,730 --> 02:30:56,230
That was a crazy throw.

2394
02:30:57,410 --> 02:30:59,130
500 miles per hour on that one.

2395
02:30:59,730 --> 02:31:00,630
What just happened?

2396
02:31:01,810 --> 02:31:02,970
I was trying to zoom.

2397
02:31:03,270 --> 02:31:07,570
And, you know, my god instinct is to press 6 and right click to zoom.

2398
02:31:08,450 --> 02:31:09,730
Oh, but I do have this one.

2399
02:31:10,450 --> 02:31:11,750
I can zoom with the bed.

2400
02:31:14,500 --> 02:31:15,480
No, I don't see anything.

2401
02:31:16,400 --> 02:31:17,220
We need the boat.

2402
02:31:18,320 --> 02:31:19,740
And we need to keep going west.

2403
02:31:20,680 --> 02:31:21,920
Hold on, am I going west?

2404
02:31:23,920 --> 02:31:26,920
Yeah, it's west.

2405
02:31:34,430 --> 02:31:37,190
But I don't recognize any of this right here.

2406
02:31:37,330 --> 02:31:38,090
This is fucked.

2407
02:31:40,350 --> 02:31:44,750
And let's not forget, at one point I went into a cave, did a bunch of digging, came out.

2408
02:31:46,710 --> 02:31:49,190
And did I even keep going west after that?

2409
02:31:49,290 --> 02:31:50,070
I don't remember.

2410
02:31:51,530 --> 02:31:53,670
Maybe I went off in a random ass direction.

2411
02:31:54,470 --> 02:31:55,850
Because I knew I had a compass.

2412
02:31:57,930 --> 02:31:59,010
This is bad.

2413
02:31:59,370 --> 02:32:00,550
This is really bad.

2414
02:32:02,230 --> 02:32:03,770
I may have lost everything again.

2415
02:32:07,870 --> 02:32:09,510
The thing is, I don't recognize these trees.

2416
02:32:11,610 --> 02:32:16,270
On the other hand, if I was flying, maybe I wouldn't have paid so much attention to these trees.

2417
02:32:17,830 --> 02:32:19,790
Let's just keep trusting in West.

2418
02:32:20,830 --> 02:32:21,790
West is best.

2419
02:32:24,210 --> 02:32:25,470
Uh, sir.

2420
02:32:25,950 --> 02:32:26,430
Please.

2421
02:32:31,460 --> 02:32:32,220
There we go.

2422
02:32:40,380 --> 02:32:45,400
Come on... I think I'm gonna need to ascend in a minute here again.

2423
02:32:46,260 --> 02:32:48,320
Gotta get up high, get a good lookout.

2424
02:32:58,600 --> 02:33:07,560
Another thing to keep in mind, you travel very fast when you're... I remember this.

2425
02:33:08,920 --> 02:33:12,100
