4002
04:10:02,990 --> 04:10:04,190
Didn't work like I thought it would.

4003
04:10:11,620 --> 04:10:12,720
This is where I was.

4004
04:10:12,980 --> 04:10:14,400
I can now follow in my footsteps.

4005
04:10:17,540 --> 04:10:19,080
What the fuck was that?

4006
04:10:19,900 --> 04:10:22,020
Invisible creatures are hitting me, I swear to god.

4007
04:10:25,180 --> 04:10:26,420
Explain that one to me.

4008
04:10:29,040 --> 04:10:29,900
You can't.

4009
04:10:32,440 --> 04:10:33,440
Checkmate, atheists.

4010
04:10:37,320 --> 04:10:38,080
Take me up.

4011
04:10:49,140 --> 04:10:54,040
Wait, I must have go... I must have gone up here.

4012
04:10:55,320 --> 04:10:55,800
Yes!

4013
04:10:57,460 --> 04:10:59,680
There's no other explanation for what happened there.

4014
04:11:00,420 --> 04:11:02,960
This is the exact same... Look at this!

4015
04:11:03,160 --> 04:11:04,640
I totally did that, didn't I?

4016
04:11:05,260 --> 04:11:06,260
Maybe not, actually.

4017
04:11:07,180 --> 04:11:07,860
Never mind.

4018
04:11:08,860 --> 04:11:09,240
Also!

4019
04:11:09,920 --> 04:11:10,580
Hold on.

4020
04:11:11,200 --> 04:11:12,960
I sense something ain't right with the world.

4021
04:11:13,580 --> 04:11:16,660
We have a banger on, and we're not max music.

4022
04:11:18,090 --> 04:11:19,530
That's just a crime right there.

4023
04:11:22,430 --> 04:11:29,970
This right here is making me think of that emote with the guy from American Psycho with the headphones on.

4024
04:11:30,770 --> 04:11:32,030
Do you know what I'm talking about?

4025
04:11:32,750 --> 04:11:33,670
That's me right now.

4026
04:11:36,770 --> 04:11:37,670
And look at this.

4027
04:11:37,990 --> 04:11:40,030
Following in the footsteps of pre-me.

4028
04:11:57,380 --> 04:11:58,480
I must have gone up here.

4029
04:11:58,560 --> 04:12:00,060
See, I'm not even thinking.

4030
04:12:00,260 --> 04:12:01,940
I'm following the path of least action.

4031
04:12:02,940 --> 04:12:03,880
This is... Ooh.

4032
04:12:05,680 --> 04:12:06,780
Hold on now.

4033
04:12:07,800 --> 04:12:08,720
What is this?

4034
04:12:10,180 --> 04:12:11,020
Where am I?

4035
04:12:24,080 --> 04:12:26,760
I am just being reminded that I do not have one of these on.

4036
04:12:32,060 --> 04:12:33,340
I need fuel at home!

4037
04:12:37,740 --> 04:12:38,400
And you know what?

4038
04:12:38,420 --> 04:12:39,060
I'm gonna leave it on.

4039
04:12:40,580 --> 04:12:42,600
I need to farm these fuckers for a little bit here.

4040
04:12:43,600 --> 04:12:45,120
I need so much fuel at home.

4041
04:12:58,230 --> 04:12:59,030
Yes, sir.

4042
04:13:01,290 --> 04:13:01,690
Beautiful.

4043
04:13:01,850 --> 04:13:03,110
And we get experience on top of it.

4044
04:13:03,210 --> 04:13:04,530
This is wonderful.

4045
04:13:06,150 --> 04:13:06,870
Give me the pie.

4046
04:13:07,410 --> 04:13:08,510
Put it in my mouth.

4047
04:13:11,850 --> 04:13:14,390
And let me chew on that and swallow it south.

4048
04:13:15,790 --> 04:13:16,930
So it goes down, you know.

4049
04:13:18,570 --> 04:13:20,790
I'm just going to keep swapping between these two here.

4050
04:13:20,910 --> 04:13:22,030
This is the strategy.

4051
04:13:25,610 --> 04:13:28,370
In fact, wait a minute!

4052
04:13:30,150 --> 04:13:32,390
Can I automatically kill these somehow?

4053
04:13:34,610 --> 04:13:38,570
I mean, I know where we have two spawners right next to each other here.

4054
04:13:40,330 --> 04:13:40,890
Ow!

4055
04:13:43,050 --> 04:13:45,350
I could probably set something up right here.

4056
04:13:47,050 --> 04:13:53,790
I mean, for now I'm gonna kill them, but... This is basically what I want, but with creepers.

4057
04:13:54,700 --> 04:13:55,700
You know what I mean?

4058
04:13:57,360 --> 04:13:58,760
But all said in one word.

4059
04:14:00,320 --> 04:14:01,120
Know what I mean?

4060
04:14:02,220 --> 04:14:02,700
There.

4061
04:14:04,240 --> 04:14:05,840
Make it easy to bounce between.

4062
04:14:11,800 --> 04:14:12,400
Come on.

4063
04:14:13,720 --> 04:14:14,620
Am I too close?

4064
04:14:19,090 --> 04:14:19,950
There we go.

4065
04:14:20,910 --> 04:14:21,670
Gang is here.

4066
04:14:24,370 --> 04:14:27,390
So it seems like they can still damage me, but they have like a melee attack.

4067
04:14:29,930 --> 04:14:31,650
12 blaze rods, that is fantastic.

4068
04:14:39,210 --> 04:14:39,610
Thanks.

4069
04:14:40,530 --> 04:14:42,930
And they've spawned... this is wonderful farm.

4070
04:14:44,090 --> 04:14:46,070
Look at the way I'm farming these fools, man.

4071
04:14:49,140 --> 04:14:53,220
It's almost, uh... Factory-like, isn't it?

4072
04:14:54,720 --> 04:14:55,280
Industrial.

4073
04:14:55,800 --> 04:14:57,120
But not really, but you know.

4074
04:14:58,840 --> 04:14:59,400
Ah!

4075
04:14:59,640 --> 04:15:00,140
You appeared.

4076
04:15:03,450 --> 04:15:04,330
More, more.

4077
04:15:05,730 --> 04:15:07,190
Near the brick fence?

4078
04:15:08,390 --> 04:15:09,310
Sure, put it there.

4079
04:15:10,770 --> 04:15:11,510
That's nice.

4080
04:15:12,110 --> 04:15:12,590
Hello.

4081
04:15:12,850 --> 04:15:13,510
How much do I have left?

4082
04:15:13,650 --> 04:15:14,190
Five minutes.

4083
04:15:16,410 --> 04:15:17,930
Ah, come down here, you.

4084
04:15:20,650 --> 04:15:21,610
How dare you.

4085
04:15:24,770 --> 04:15:26,250
See, he hit me there.

4086
04:15:27,450 --> 04:15:30,370
He took out his hand and just slapped me across the face.

4087
04:15:31,750 --> 04:15:34,290
And it really did hurt.

4088
04:15:35,050 --> 04:15:35,190
Ow.

4089
04:15:36,010 --> 04:15:37,930
Or as a German would say, awa.

4090
04:15:38,630 --> 04:15:39,430
Isn't that funny?

4091
04:15:40,130 --> 04:15:49,770
How different nationalities have different reactionary vocalizations based on getting hurt, you know?

4092
04:15:51,800 --> 04:15:55,940
Their instinct is to go... But in America, it's ouch.

4093
04:15:56,660 --> 04:15:57,900
And in Denmark, it's ouch.

4094
04:15:58,920 --> 04:16:00,440
But it's all kind of similar, isn't it?

4095
04:16:03,910 --> 04:16:08,730
It's like in Denmark, for example, when we sneeze, we actually don't make a sneeze sound.

4096
04:16:08,850 --> 04:16:11,510
We say... every time.

4097
04:16:11,930 --> 04:16:13,030
And it's like a Danish thing.

4098
04:16:13,450 --> 04:16:18,270
Whereas in the Netherlands, I know this for a fact, I've seen it multiple times, they go... you know?

4099
04:16:18,490 --> 04:16:19,270
But not like that.

4100
04:16:19,390 --> 04:16:21,630
I can't say it because I can't speak Dutch.

4101
04:16:22,650 --> 04:16:24,570
But that's what they do every time they sneeze.

4102
04:16:24,690 --> 04:16:25,130
Isn't that funny?

4103
04:16:26,650 --> 04:16:27,510
You know what else is funny?

4104
04:16:27,570 --> 04:16:28,470
I made that whole shit up.

4105
04:16:28,570 --> 04:16:29,190
None of that was true.

4106
04:16:31,270 --> 04:16:31,590
Gotcha!

4107
04:16:42,030 --> 04:16:42,390
Die!

4108
04:16:42,390 --> 04:16:43,210
How much do I have?

4109
04:16:43,370 --> 04:16:43,730
18.

4110
04:16:45,210 --> 04:16:46,510
That's enough to get into a bar.

4111
04:16:47,770 --> 04:16:48,670
At least in Denmark.

4112
04:16:50,850 --> 04:16:51,390
Hey, you!

4113
04:16:55,030 --> 04:16:55,390
Thanks.

4114
04:16:56,130 --> 04:16:56,490
20?

4115
04:16:56,650 --> 04:16:57,230
That's a good amount.

4116
04:16:57,470 --> 04:16:57,690
We're leaving.

4117
04:16:59,650 --> 04:17:00,850
Home is that way, in fact.

4118
04:17:00,990 --> 04:17:01,810
Oh, did we overshoot?

4119
04:17:02,170 --> 04:17:02,770
No way!

4120
04:17:06,380 --> 04:17:07,260
Wait a minute.

4121
04:17:07,400 --> 04:17:08,620
Where exactly am I right now?

4122
04:17:09,780 --> 04:17:11,260
Which fortress is this?

4123
04:17:16,080 --> 04:17:17,360
I don't care about you.

4124
04:17:18,760 --> 04:17:20,480
It's saying this way.

4125
04:17:21,760 --> 04:17:23,160
Also, I'm seeing experience.

4126
04:17:23,160 --> 04:17:23,860
I gotta get it.

4127
04:17:25,240 --> 04:17:26,200
Oh, yeah!

4128
04:17:33,280 --> 04:17:40,320
This somehow turned from being a major disaster into a very successful trip.

4129
04:17:41,600 --> 04:17:43,320
And all it cost us was a bow.

4130
04:17:44,260 --> 04:17:46,580
Pretty decent bow, granted, but you know.

4131
04:17:52,400 --> 04:17:55,520
Wait, am I wearing... Ooh, my gold boots are almost done.

4132
04:17:57,300 --> 04:17:58,880
That is kind of a problem.

4133
04:18:08,300 --> 04:18:08,860
Thanks.

4134
04:18:09,820 --> 04:18:11,580
Thanks a lot, Brohan.

4135
04:18:18,240 --> 04:18:19,840
Okay, that's not looking good.

4136
04:18:20,600 --> 04:18:22,820
I think it's time to start digging.

4137
04:18:24,180 --> 04:18:25,800
No, actually, that's a terrible idea.

4138
04:18:25,960 --> 04:18:29,700
We should just keep looking for open places like this.

4139
04:18:30,040 --> 04:18:32,980
Where we have, like, exposed quartz.

4140
04:18:33,340 --> 04:18:35,020
Exposed quartz is best quartz.

4141
04:18:37,970 --> 04:18:43,390
That's what a guy who was very smart at very many things once said.

4142
04:18:44,930 --> 04:18:45,810
And, yeah.

4143
04:18:48,790 --> 04:18:49,910
Oh my god.

4144
04:18:52,290 --> 04:18:53,550
I gotta be honest.

4145
04:18:53,690 --> 04:18:57,890
I'm a little bit... I'm still riding the wave of hype of recovering my items.

4146
04:18:58,210 --> 04:19:00,670
I'm being a little jolly and silly, you know?

4147
04:19:01,050 --> 04:19:02,150
I'm being jilly.

4148
04:19:02,350 --> 04:19:03,090
Or jolly.

4149
04:19:04,630 --> 04:19:05,550
Both, I guess.

4150
04:19:07,800 --> 04:19:08,320
Solly.

4151
04:19:08,320 --> 04:19:11,100
It's a guy who landed a plane in the Hudson River.

4152
04:19:12,640 --> 04:19:13,520
That's a fact.

4153
04:19:14,040 --> 04:19:14,960
More basalts.

4154
04:19:19,880 --> 04:19:20,400
Thanks.

4155
04:19:20,840 --> 04:19:21,820
I need some over there.

4156
04:19:22,360 --> 04:19:23,320
I can't get there.

4157
04:19:23,880 --> 04:19:25,100
That's a bit sus.

4158
04:19:27,660 --> 04:19:29,100
I wouldn't say that word.

4159
04:19:29,260 --> 04:19:33,340
I'm only saying it to highlight what the kids nowadays are saying.

4160
04:19:42,710 --> 04:19:43,270
Nice.

4161
04:19:44,050 --> 04:19:45,910
That spot has been licked clean.

4162
04:19:46,950 --> 04:19:48,550
Now we go to the other side.

4163
04:19:48,850 --> 04:19:50,650
In fact, we only have four taters left.

4164
04:19:51,490 --> 04:19:53,750
That is... I'm gonna dig towards my compass now.

4165
04:19:55,130 --> 04:19:56,550
We're going compass direction.

4166
04:19:58,250 --> 04:19:59,190
Ah, that's bad.

4167
04:20:01,550 --> 04:20:02,110
Stop.

4168
04:20:04,450 --> 04:20:05,750
I'm assuming it's up.

4169
04:20:08,820 --> 04:20:15,720
I have no reason to think why, but I just feel like it is, you know?

4170
04:20:16,200 --> 04:20:18,060
Yeah, because the fortress is here.

4171
04:20:22,000 --> 04:20:22,480
Aha!

4172
04:20:23,060 --> 04:20:24,300
Look at that, will ya?

4173
04:20:25,320 --> 04:20:26,280
I made that.

4174
04:20:26,960 --> 04:20:27,940
That's a ladder.

4175
04:20:29,640 --> 04:20:33,080
Which also means this place is probably picked clean of experience.

4176
04:20:34,180 --> 04:20:36,080
So, uh, yeah.

4177
04:20:36,320 --> 04:20:37,540
Not gonna get much out of here.

4178
04:20:39,580 --> 04:20:41,220
I do see some, actually, over here.

4179
04:20:42,500 --> 04:20:43,240
I'll take it.

4180
04:20:49,980 --> 04:20:51,700
Oh, I saw you.

4181
04:20:53,880 --> 04:20:54,880
I see more.

4182
04:21:06,600 --> 04:21:07,720
A little bit risky.

4183
04:21:10,360 --> 04:21:12,700
You gotta be risky to get the bisky, you know?

4184
04:21:27,860 --> 04:21:28,380
Lovely.

4185
04:21:29,440 --> 04:21:30,380
And there's more.

4186
04:21:49,260 --> 04:21:54,600
The nice thing about the experience is I always catch it even though the stuff I'm mining is falling into the lava.

4187
04:21:56,160 --> 04:21:57,420
So, yeah, that's nice.

4188
04:22:08,280 --> 04:22:09,000
All right.

4189
04:22:13,920 --> 04:22:17,480
Also, how am I... Oh...

4190
04:22:23,490 --> 04:22:25,590
My pickaxe is eating my experience.

4191
04:22:25,590 --> 04:22:27,670
I was wondering, how am I stuck on 20?

4192
04:22:30,290 --> 04:22:31,530
It just occurred to me.

4193
04:22:31,930 --> 04:22:33,870
I looked like a minute ago, I was like, okay.

4194
04:22:35,030 --> 04:22:36,170
Wow, I'm not 21 yet.

4195
04:22:36,610 --> 04:22:38,950
And then I looked again, and I was like, whoa, something ain't right.

4196
04:22:40,450 --> 04:22:41,190
That's the reason.

4197
04:22:41,890 --> 04:22:42,710
Fuck me, man.

4198
04:22:44,210 --> 04:22:45,030
I don't have a choice.

4199
04:22:45,110 --> 04:22:46,370
I have to feed the pickaxe first.

4200
04:22:47,710 --> 04:22:48,630
It is what it is.

4201
04:22:51,130 --> 04:22:53,470
That's actually the downside of having mending.

4202
04:22:59,870 --> 04:23:01,210
Ah, oh god.

4203
04:23:01,450 --> 04:23:02,550
I'm in a very bad spot.

4204
04:23:03,250 --> 04:23:04,110
Fuck off.

4205
04:23:07,010 --> 04:23:07,950
Let me jump down.

4206
04:23:16,140 --> 04:23:18,600
Man, I've been here so many times, there's just nothing left.

4207
04:23:19,340 --> 04:23:19,880
Nothing.

4208
04:23:20,400 --> 04:23:21,380
There's some down there.

4209
04:23:23,080 --> 04:23:26,060
I'm gonna go get it.

4210
04:23:28,460 --> 04:23:29,000
Aha!

4211
04:23:33,500 --> 04:23:34,160
Come here.

4212
04:23:37,960 --> 04:23:40,100
Oh, he appeared fast!

4213
04:23:46,510 --> 04:23:47,350
That's another thing.

4214
04:23:47,470 --> 04:23:50,110
I need these Ender Pearls so I can make Ender Crystals.

4215
04:23:51,410 --> 04:23:52,570
You come here as well.

4216
04:23:55,570 --> 04:23:56,210
Where'd you go?

4217
04:23:57,050 --> 04:23:57,590
There we go.

4218
04:23:57,870 --> 04:23:58,130
Got him.

4219
04:24:06,590 --> 04:24:07,110
Hey!

4220
04:24:14,150 --> 04:24:14,670
Nice.

4221
04:24:17,800 --> 04:24:20,760
This biome right here is terrible for experience, although I see some over there.

4222
04:24:23,300 --> 04:24:25,220
Why did I do that risky-ass jump?

4223
04:24:25,340 --> 04:24:25,980
That was dumb.

4224
04:24:27,020 --> 04:24:27,740
You know what?

4225
04:24:27,920 --> 04:24:29,440
I should probably drink this.

4226
04:24:30,260 --> 04:24:32,420
Because if I fell in lava there, lights out.

4227
04:24:34,380 --> 04:24:35,300
Absolutely lights out.

4228
04:24:37,100 --> 04:24:37,940
Everyone knows it.

4229
04:24:42,980 --> 04:24:45,460
Wait a minute, dude, I just had a great idea!

4230
04:24:46,960 --> 04:24:48,220
Holy shit, I'm smart.

4231
04:24:49,100 --> 04:24:49,420
Guys!

4232
04:24:59,230 --> 04:25:02,090
That's the solution in the nether when you have fire protection.

4233
04:25:02,990 --> 04:25:04,630
That is wonderful.

4234
04:25:06,410 --> 04:25:07,630
Oh, man.

4235
04:25:08,850 --> 04:25:09,810
Actually, genius.

4236
04:25:10,250 --> 04:25:11,570
Why didn't I think about that?

4237
04:25:12,610 --> 04:25:13,570
Fuck yeah, man.

4238
04:25:16,500 --> 04:25:18,940
I feel like I'm getting so many great ideas today.

4239
04:25:19,080 --> 04:25:19,640
Holy shit.

4240
04:25:20,760 --> 04:25:21,980
Like, more than usual, you know?

4241
04:25:22,100 --> 04:25:23,160
Okay, I have two taters left.

4242
04:25:23,940 --> 04:25:25,720
It may be time to get the hell out.

4243
04:25:26,380 --> 04:25:29,040
Because soon I won't be able to get out, you know?

4244
04:25:30,060 --> 04:25:30,420
Yeah.

4245
04:25:30,860 --> 04:25:31,900
Let's actually just get out.

4246
04:25:32,700 --> 04:25:33,560
Look for the exit.

4247
04:25:34,200 --> 04:25:34,800
Right meow.

4248
04:25:35,980 --> 04:25:37,240
And yes, I said meow.

4249
04:25:37,740 --> 04:25:38,680
What are you gonna do about it?

4250
04:25:43,100 --> 04:25:43,920
I'm gonna get up here.

4251
04:25:45,520 --> 04:25:46,160
Oh, hello!

4252
04:25:49,800 --> 04:25:50,840
I'll take that, thanks.

4253
04:25:51,740 --> 04:25:52,680
You don't need that.

4254
04:25:54,320 --> 04:25:55,080
Uh, whoop!

4255
04:25:55,400 --> 04:25:56,080
Careful now.

4256
04:25:57,260 --> 04:26:01,080
I just want to get up to, uh... I was about to say eye-level oven, but, uh...

4257
04:26:04,230 --> 04:26:05,650
Feet level fortress.

4258
04:26:07,250 --> 04:26:08,310
What the fuck is this?

4259
04:26:08,470 --> 04:26:08,890
Where am I?

4260
04:26:09,970 --> 04:26:11,050
Why does it look like this?

4261
04:26:13,070 --> 04:26:13,410
Ah!

4262
04:26:14,950 --> 04:26:15,290
Intriguing.

4263
04:26:16,670 --> 04:26:17,970
Okay, so it's this way.

4264
04:26:19,730 --> 04:26:22,430
But I have a feeling that... Oh yeah, oh yeah, I see.

4265
04:26:23,830 --> 04:26:24,750
I know how to get home.

4266
04:26:32,250 --> 04:26:33,610
Look at that portal.

4267
04:26:34,250 --> 04:26:35,630
Wonder where that leads.

4268
04:26:40,350 --> 04:26:43,750
Wait a sec.

4269
04:26:48,140 --> 04:26:49,920
Now I'm not so sure where I am.

4270
04:26:52,540 --> 04:26:53,380
Not that it matters.

4271
04:26:53,560 --> 04:26:54,040
We have a compass.

4272
04:26:56,860 --> 04:27:00,780
The only thing is, this compass doesn't show us the height of the destination, you know?

4273
04:27:02,620 --> 04:27:03,620
So it could be up or down.

4274
04:27:03,720 --> 04:27:04,400
It's probably up.

4275
04:27:07,060 --> 04:27:08,460
I don't want to go digging like that.

4276
04:27:08,480 --> 04:27:09,260
That's a horrible idea.

4277
04:27:19,960 --> 04:27:22,640
Okay, so my pickaxe is soon satiated.

4278
04:27:23,340 --> 04:27:25,120
My pickaxe soon well fed.

4279
04:27:25,620 --> 04:27:27,720
Which means it's time for me to eat.

4280
04:27:28,180 --> 04:27:29,780
And boy, am I hungry.

4281
04:27:30,900 --> 04:27:32,600
In fact, I'm also hungry in real life.

4282
04:27:33,660 --> 04:27:34,740
I'm kind of starving.

4283
04:27:35,420 --> 04:27:37,680
But I really want to get home first.

4284
04:27:38,160 --> 04:27:39,360
Before anything else.

4285
04:27:39,700 --> 04:27:41,060
And get that experience.

4286
04:27:41,420 --> 04:27:41,760
Hello.

4287
04:27:44,200 --> 04:27:45,060
Wait a minute.

4288
04:27:46,140 --> 04:27:47,400
I remember this spot.

4289
04:27:47,800 --> 04:27:49,600
I was very confused in this spot before.

4290
04:27:53,220 --> 04:27:53,820
Bitch!

4291
04:27:55,220 --> 04:27:55,820
What?

4292
04:27:57,760 --> 04:27:59,120
I took damage from that!

4293
04:28:03,860 --> 04:28:04,460
What?

4294
04:28:04,600 --> 04:28:04,820
Why?

4295
04:28:05,200 --> 04:28:06,240
Did I mistime it?

4296
04:28:10,080 --> 04:28:10,860
Wait a minute.

4297
04:28:12,380 --> 04:28:14,320
Oh, I have an idea.

4298
04:28:18,180 --> 04:28:18,660
Nah.

4299
04:28:19,000 --> 04:28:19,280
Nah, nah, nah.

4300
04:28:20,240 --> 04:28:21,020
Let me try again.

4301
04:28:22,980 --> 04:28:24,540
No, that one... Hmm.

4302
04:28:26,040 --> 04:28:29,920
Wait a minute, maybe lava doesn't actually shock-absorb you.

4303
04:28:31,180 --> 04:28:32,300
I mean, if you... Okay.

4304
04:28:32,800 --> 04:28:43,680
One thing is, it's not very wise to compare this game to real life a lot of the time, but in real life, if you were to jump onto lava, I don't think you would fall into it like water, right?

4305
04:28:43,960 --> 04:28:45,080
It's fucking rock!

4306
04:28:46,090 --> 04:28:47,910
But this is Minecraft, so who the fuck knows.

4307
04:28:52,110 --> 04:28:52,950
Needs more testing.

4308
04:28:55,390 --> 04:28:56,210
Should be up here.

4309
04:29:04,430 --> 04:29:04,950
Oh god.

4310
04:29:06,390 --> 04:29:07,350
Do I even care?

4311
04:29:09,050 --> 04:29:10,170
Wait, is it right above me?

4312
04:29:15,140 --> 04:29:16,200
Why are you so passive?

4313
04:29:18,440 --> 04:29:19,680
Are you alright, sir?

4314
04:29:19,920 --> 04:29:21,340
What the hell was that all about?

4315
04:29:23,520 --> 04:29:23,960
Weird.

4316
04:29:24,800 --> 04:29:29,600
Okay, so the compass is saying... Right here.

4317
04:29:30,940 --> 04:29:32,200
It's, yeah, it's right above me.

4318
04:29:34,300 --> 04:29:35,100
There's no way.

4319
04:29:35,240 --> 04:29:35,360
How?

4320
04:29:41,140 --> 04:29:41,800
Wait, what?

4321
04:29:42,600 --> 04:29:43,620
There's dirt here.

4322
04:29:54,530 --> 04:29:55,590
It's above me?

4323
04:29:59,350 --> 04:29:59,910
What?

4324
04:30:16,950 --> 04:30:17,730
Oh no.

4325
04:30:21,010 --> 04:30:22,170
It's gotta be below me.

4326
04:30:27,490 --> 04:30:28,530
I'm losing my mind.

4327
04:30:30,370 --> 04:30:33,050
It's not, man, it's not easy even with a compass.

4328
04:30:36,130 --> 04:30:36,890
Oh, nice.

4329
04:30:37,130 --> 04:30:38,110
We got some music at least.

4330
04:30:39,990 --> 04:30:41,130
That makes me feel better.

4331
04:30:46,050 --> 04:30:46,830
Wait a minute.

4332
04:30:53,660 --> 04:30:55,840
Hold on, I just had a crazy flashback.

4333
04:30:56,840 --> 04:30:59,600
I was doing this exact same thing before.

4334
04:30:59,920 --> 04:31:01,300
In this exact spot.

4335
04:31:02,660 --> 04:31:06,160
But that was a lodestone that is no longer here.

4336
04:31:08,620 --> 04:31:10,120
That lodestone is gone.

4337
04:31:13,140 --> 04:31:13,780
What?

4338
04:31:18,190 --> 04:31:19,130
Wait a minute.

4339
04:31:20,590 --> 04:31:21,630
Okay, so, okay.

4340
04:31:22,070 --> 04:31:23,370
We have an SLJ here.

4341
04:31:25,210 --> 04:31:26,490
Trust in the SLJ.

4342
04:31:26,750 --> 04:31:28,190
Something ain't right with my compass.

4343
04:31:30,390 --> 04:31:32,170
Right now we can't trust the instruments.

4344
04:31:33,050 --> 04:31:35,090
IFR flying is out the window.

4345
04:31:35,710 --> 04:31:37,170
It's VFR rules now.

4346
04:31:47,740 --> 04:31:51,680
So this leads... here.

4347
04:31:54,690 --> 04:31:58,730
Oh, fu- wha- What?

4348
04:31:59,710 --> 04:32:00,370
Okay.

4349
04:32:00,650 --> 04:32:02,390
I don't understand what's happening.

4350
04:32:03,250 --> 04:32:03,930
Uh-oh.

4351
04:32:05,030 --> 04:32:07,390
My last tater is in my tummy.

4352
04:32:08,150 --> 04:32:09,910
And we have a guest!

4353
04:32:12,270 --> 04:32:14,430
I'm actually gonna fuck you up with my sword.

4354
04:32:15,210 --> 04:32:15,970
I can't?

4355
04:32:16,990 --> 04:32:17,650
Okay.

4356
04:32:18,410 --> 04:32:18,770
RUT!

4357
04:32:19,370 --> 04:32:20,510
Follow the SLJ.

4358
04:32:24,650 --> 04:32:26,630
Also, don't run because we have no more food.

4359
04:32:28,570 --> 04:32:30,110
Why can I not trust my compass?

4360
04:32:30,270 --> 04:32:31,130
Something is wrong with it.

4361
04:32:35,670 --> 04:32:37,590
I remember this stuff right here.

4362
04:32:46,660 --> 04:32:50,380
Oh, no, no, no, wait, wait, this is... No, this is the demon portal!

4363
04:32:52,660 --> 04:32:53,100
Fuck!

4364
04:32:54,020 --> 04:32:55,100
It is this way.

4365
04:32:59,120 --> 04:33:00,500
So it's definitely this way.

4366
04:33:04,420 --> 04:33:05,920
Maybe the compass is right.

4367
04:33:08,820 --> 04:33:09,500
Okay, okay.

4368
04:33:10,260 --> 04:33:12,240
I know how to test this 100%.

4369
04:33:12,240 --> 04:33:15,880
We're gonna go to where the compass is going, you know?

4370
04:33:16,200 --> 04:33:20,120
And as soon as it does, we're gonna go straight up and straight down.

4371
04:33:20,340 --> 04:33:23,460
Because then we guarantee to hit it, if it is actually pointing to the right thing.

4372
04:33:27,520 --> 04:33:28,840
Okay, compass is going wild.

4373
04:33:31,560 --> 04:33:32,180
Right here!

4374
04:33:33,260 --> 04:33:34,020
Ooh, careful.

4375
04:33:38,170 --> 04:33:39,570
But this doesn't make any sense.

4376
04:33:41,650 --> 04:33:42,170
Whatever.

4377
04:33:42,430 --> 04:33:43,290
I'm gonna trust in it.

4378
04:33:43,630 --> 04:33:44,430
We're trusting.

4379
04:33:47,510 --> 04:33:49,150
Back to view... I mean IFR.

4380
04:33:58,370 --> 04:33:59,510
Yeah, look at the compass.

4381
04:33:59,890 --> 04:34:01,210
This is the block.

4382
04:34:01,970 --> 04:34:03,210
If it is indeed working.

4383
04:34:09,260 --> 04:34:10,180
Wait, which one was it?

4384
04:34:10,460 --> 04:34:10,920
This one.

4385
04:34:11,180 --> 04:34:11,700
No, wait.

4386
04:34:13,800 --> 04:34:14,820
Yeah, this one.

4387
04:34:20,420 --> 04:34:21,120
Oh my god.

4388
04:34:25,380 --> 04:34:26,840
Well, how about that?

4389
04:34:27,800 --> 04:34:29,480
Oh, and my phone is ringing.

4390
04:34:30,520 --> 04:34:31,980
Oh, it's weird.

4391
04:34:33,000 --> 04:34:35,300
I had an alarm for 2230 for some reason.

4392
04:34:37,220 --> 04:34:38,240
Well, I made it!

4393
04:34:38,360 --> 04:34:38,840
Fucking hell!

4394
04:34:39,600 --> 04:34:41,900
I guess from now on, we're gonna trust the instruments.

4395
04:34:42,400 --> 04:34:43,820
No more VR4 flying.

4396
04:34:44,060 --> 04:34:45,460
You know, I actually made the...

4397
04:34:45,880 --> 04:34:49,180
I made the exact mistake you should never do when flying.

4398
04:34:49,960 --> 04:34:53,040
Convince yourself... Oh, the instruments must be wrong.

4399
04:34:53,200 --> 04:34:54,220
I trust my eyes.

4400
04:34:54,300 --> 04:34:55,720
I trust my inner ear, you know?

4401
04:34:56,040 --> 04:34:58,060
I can tell when I'm upside down.

4402
04:34:58,860 --> 04:34:59,340
Jim.

4403
04:35:00,160 --> 04:35:01,520
You listening, Jim?

4404
04:35:01,900 --> 04:35:02,840
Never do that.

4405
04:35:03,040 --> 04:35:03,880
Trust the instruments.

4406
04:35:05,460 --> 04:35:06,360
God damn it.

4407
04:35:06,520 --> 04:35:12,280
And I just demonstrated why you should never fly in bad weather without instruments and knowing how to read them.

4408
04:35:12,460 --> 04:35:12,840
There it is.

4409
04:35:14,010 --> 04:35:14,470
Bam!

4410
04:35:14,690 --> 04:35:14,850
Boom!

4411
04:35:15,470 --> 04:35:16,190
Bada boom!

4412
04:35:16,470 --> 04:35:17,150
Automata Pia.

4413
04:35:17,290 --> 04:35:17,510
We're done.

4414
04:35:18,710 --> 04:35:19,310
That's it.

4415
04:35:19,510 --> 04:35:19,850
Whoa!

4416
04:35:20,750 --> 04:35:22,090
That was a stream, wasn't it?

4417
04:35:33,190 --> 04:35:34,290
Alright, there we go, there we go.

4418
04:35:36,630 --> 04:35:37,810
I don't know why, guys.

4419
04:35:37,810 --> 04:35:40,590
I felt especially disconnected from you guys today.

4420
04:35:42,930 --> 04:35:43,810
What's happening?

4421
04:35:45,730 --> 04:35:48,270
I'm glad you approve of my vocabulary, at least.

4422
04:35:48,370 --> 04:35:48,570
Thanks.

4423
04:35:52,200 --> 04:35:53,480
Stop that right meow.

4424
04:35:55,360 --> 04:35:56,060
Stop it.

4425
04:35:58,740 --> 04:36:00,960
Guys, can you believe I recovered my shit?

4426
04:36:01,280 --> 04:36:01,760
Huh?

4427
04:36:02,080 --> 04:36:03,540
Tell me, did you have a prediction on it?

4428
04:36:04,020 --> 04:36:04,740
Let's hear it.

4429
04:36:06,940 --> 04:36:08,700
What do I got to do about it?

4430
04:36:11,620 --> 04:36:12,280
Let's see.

4431
04:36:15,280 --> 04:36:17,200
I was a believer?

4432
04:36:17,400 --> 04:36:17,660
Yes!

4433
04:36:21,870 --> 04:36:24,270
You had no prediction, but I believed.

4434
04:36:24,450 --> 04:36:24,830
Oh, okay.

4435
04:36:25,410 --> 04:36:25,770
Great.

4436
04:36:27,090 --> 04:36:27,930
Be honest here.

4437
04:36:28,430 --> 04:36:32,170
When you look at a Snapchat of the chat, when I ask that, how many were believers?

4438
04:36:32,730 --> 04:36:33,450
Give me a percentage.

4439
04:36:34,730 --> 04:36:36,210
I need to know if there were doubters.

4440
04:36:36,390 --> 04:36:37,150
I need to know.

4441
04:36:44,150 --> 04:36:45,110
50-50?

4442
04:36:45,470 --> 04:36:46,270
Damn, okay.

4443
04:36:47,350 --> 04:37:09,410
Because at the time, I was pretty sure in my mind, like I had a sneaking suspicion, that the Pale Forest that I was in, when I tried to recover it the first time, was the right one, and I just sucked at not recognizing it.

4444
04:37:09,530 --> 04:37:11,350
Or at recognizing that it was...

4445
04:37:11,560 --> 04:37:12,580
The right one, you know?

4446
04:37:12,860 --> 04:37:15,960
That I left it behind and I just imagined all of you screaming.

4447
04:37:16,300 --> 04:37:18,240
Being like, no, it's right there, you know?

4448
04:37:18,400 --> 04:37:20,320
I had that thought in the back of my mind.

4449
04:37:21,580 --> 04:37:22,800
But I trusted my God.

4450
04:37:22,960 --> 04:37:24,920
I could not recognize any of it.

4451
04:37:25,640 --> 04:37:26,040
Right?

4452
04:37:26,440 --> 04:37:28,820
That's why I was so insistent and I kept going.

4453
04:37:34,550 --> 04:37:36,170
You got unlucky and lucky.

4454
04:37:36,330 --> 04:37:36,590
Yes.

4455
04:37:37,690 --> 04:37:42,570
So I actually had two of those biomes that I had never seen before, by the way, in this game.

4456
04:37:42,870 --> 04:37:43,310
Ever.

4457
04:37:44,310 --> 04:37:45,930
Twice in the same stream.

4458
04:37:46,770 --> 04:37:47,730
What the hell?

4459
04:37:51,990 --> 04:37:53,590
What do you think that biome is called?

4460
04:37:54,290 --> 04:37:55,190
Pale Forest?

4461
04:37:56,310 --> 04:37:56,830
Probably.

4462
04:37:58,930 --> 04:37:59,690
What's it called?

4463
04:38:05,960 --> 04:38:06,580
Close enough?

4464
04:38:08,000 --> 04:38:08,720
Pale Garden?

4465
04:38:09,320 --> 04:38:09,940
Oh, okay.

4466
04:38:10,460 --> 04:38:11,240
Yeah, I was close, I guess.

4467
04:38:12,400 --> 04:38:12,760
Rotund?

4468
04:38:12,880 --> 04:38:13,400
Yeah, Rotund.

4469
04:38:13,480 --> 04:38:14,200
Sorry, I should have said that.

4470
04:38:16,480 --> 04:38:18,460
Would you be willing to bet you've never seen it before?

4471
04:38:19,140 --> 04:38:19,500
Yeah?

4472
04:38:20,240 --> 04:38:22,780
I mean... Uh, okay.

4473
04:38:23,140 --> 04:38:23,820
Hold on, hold on.

4474
04:38:23,980 --> 04:38:25,080
No, no, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

4475
04:38:25,360 --> 04:38:26,420
Since you're asking like that?

4476
04:38:26,760 --> 04:38:27,620
Wait, wait a minute.

4477
04:38:27,820 --> 04:38:28,160
Hold on.

4478
04:38:29,720 --> 04:38:33,480
Uh... I would bet that I haven't seen it...

4479
04:38:35,560 --> 04:38:36,560
And recognized it.

4480
04:38:36,760 --> 04:38:37,660
That something was off.

4481
04:38:39,000 --> 04:38:39,880
That's what I would say.

4482
04:38:43,400 --> 04:38:45,060
Maybe I've seen it before, I don't know.

4483
04:38:47,100 --> 04:38:48,260
I've probably seen it before then.

4484
04:38:49,700 --> 04:38:55,080
Which would make sense, because I had the theory that I was in that area before because of the whole portal connecting to the portal in the nether, right?

4485
04:38:56,260 --> 04:38:57,380
It's been on screen before?

4486
04:38:57,700 --> 04:38:58,600
Okay, I read that.

4487
04:38:58,720 --> 04:38:59,160
But that's fine.

4488
04:38:59,880 --> 04:39:02,760
I mean, it doesn't surprise me I was in that area, right?

4489
04:39:03,480 --> 04:39:09,080
The fact that that portal linked to the one in the nether, it must have meant that I've been in that area.

4490
04:39:09,680 --> 04:39:10,140
Yeah.

4491
04:39:13,500 --> 04:39:14,500
Welcome from Canada.

4492
04:39:14,860 --> 04:39:15,260
Hey!

4493
04:39:15,860 --> 04:39:16,200
Sup!

4494
04:39:21,400 --> 04:39:26,380
Today it was so over, and then we were so back, and then it was mega over, and then we were so back.

4495
04:39:27,920 --> 04:39:29,900
I love that.

4496
04:39:31,100 --> 04:39:33,160
Guys, where does that expression come from?

4497
04:39:33,700 --> 04:39:35,740
That meme with the it's so over.

4498
04:39:36,380 --> 04:39:37,600
Does anyone know this?

4499
04:39:38,160 --> 04:39:38,960
It's hilarious.

4500
04:39:45,140 --> 04:39:46,340
Look at the Minecraft menu.

4501
04:39:46,480 --> 04:39:47,300
I already closed the game.

4502
04:39:47,420 --> 04:39:47,760
Wait, what?

4503
04:39:47,900 --> 04:39:48,220
What do you mean?

4504
04:39:52,500 --> 04:39:53,420
Minecraft menu?

4505
04:39:54,380 --> 04:39:56,140
You mean like the statistics or something?

4506
04:39:57,420 --> 04:39:58,500
Hi from North Germany.

4507
04:39:59,120 --> 04:40:00,640
Hey, how are you, Animas?

4508
04:40:03,180 --> 04:40:04,820
I hope it's good for you.

4509
04:40:05,580 --> 04:40:11,520
And I also hope that you have a fantastic weekend.

4510
04:40:13,040 --> 04:40:15,840
Goddamn, I can't even remember my German.

4511
04:40:18,270 --> 04:40:20,810
The slow magma cube chased through lava was pretty great.

4512
04:40:20,950 --> 04:40:21,790
You know what's funny about that?

4513
04:40:22,350 --> 04:40:28,510
As soon as I got on land, I realized within me, dude, you were fire immune.

4514
04:40:28,690 --> 04:40:33,630
You could have just sort of bounced on the fire for a little longer and just hit it until it died.

4515
04:40:34,290 --> 04:40:37,410
The thing is, it would have kept spawning smaller ones and it would have been a disaster.

4516
04:40:38,330 --> 04:40:41,390
Maybe I could have done it like that, but I definitely felt panic, you know?

4517
04:40:42,870 --> 04:40:43,810
It was scary.

4518
04:40:46,200 --> 04:40:48,220
Oh my god, a lot of things are being deleted.

4519
04:40:48,360 --> 04:40:49,200
Guys, don't spoil anything.

4520
04:40:51,400 --> 04:40:53,200
We should play this hit game called Minecraft.

4521
04:40:53,460 --> 04:40:54,860
It's great, I've played it.

4522
04:40:55,740 --> 04:40:56,820
It's a really good game.

4523
04:41:00,620 --> 04:41:03,980
You can change the amount of RAM allocated to Minecraft on the title screen.

4524
04:41:04,160 --> 04:41:04,760
Might help with stuttering.

4525
04:41:04,900 --> 04:41:06,320
Okay, you got it.

4526
04:41:08,760 --> 04:41:10,020
In fact, I'm gonna write that down.

4527
04:41:12,880 --> 04:41:14,940
Title screen, RAM.

4528
04:41:21,220 --> 04:41:21,640
Okay.

4529
04:41:24,800 --> 04:41:25,240
Thanks.

4530
04:41:25,600 --> 04:41:26,520
Thank you, it's good.

4531
04:41:26,680 --> 04:41:27,980
I also play Minecraft.

4532
04:41:28,300 --> 04:41:29,340
Ah, very nice.

4533
04:41:31,100 --> 04:41:34,020
Have you played it already or is this your first time?

4534
04:41:37,240 --> 04:41:41,560
Yeah, sorry, I'm speaking German with my favorite new viewer here, who's also German, you know?

4535
04:41:43,760 --> 04:41:52,340
I mean, honestly, anytime I can speak German, I would love to, because it's a good way of keeping the language known to me.

4536
04:41:52,460 --> 04:41:54,440
Otherwise, I will forget all the words if I don't use it.

4537
04:41:54,880 --> 04:41:56,200
Use it or lose it, right?

4538
04:41:57,460 --> 04:41:58,080
I'm kidding.

4539
04:41:58,240 --> 04:41:58,740
Come on, guys.

4540
04:42:00,600 --> 04:42:02,500
The Germans get the exclusive Oliver lore.

4541
04:42:02,720 --> 04:42:03,140
Oh, yeah.

4542
04:42:03,540 --> 04:42:04,400
It's so over.

4543
04:42:06,700 --> 04:42:08,280
Wasn't it your birthday today or something?

4544
04:42:14,020 --> 04:42:15,520
How many languages you speak?

4545
04:42:15,700 --> 04:42:16,120
Seven.

4546
04:42:20,000 --> 04:42:21,260
Six of them fluently.

4547
04:42:21,980 --> 04:42:23,380
Nah, I'm messing with you, come on.

4548
04:42:23,780 --> 04:42:27,780
I speak English, German, Danish... and that's it.

4549
04:42:32,830 --> 04:42:34,410
I got whiplash hearing birthday.

4550
04:42:34,610 --> 04:42:35,630
Oh, I wasn't talking to you.

4551
04:42:35,730 --> 04:42:37,670
I was talking to my new favorite viewer from Germany.

4552
04:42:38,830 --> 04:42:40,970
Who coincidentally also has a birthday today.

4553
04:42:47,740 --> 04:42:50,780
Oliver, you cannot, in fact, allocate more RAM from the title screen.

4554
04:42:50,860 --> 04:42:51,020
Okay.

4555
04:42:51,600 --> 04:42:52,580
I'm taking my notes.

4556
04:42:52,740 --> 04:42:56,920
I'm gonna write, in fact, I can't.

4557
04:42:58,320 --> 04:42:58,760
Thanks.

4558
04:43:00,360 --> 04:43:01,220
It has been noted.

4559
04:43:01,960 --> 04:43:03,620
I don't know what to believe anymore!

4560
04:43:04,800 --> 04:43:05,240
Guys!

4561
04:43:05,780 --> 04:43:06,520
What's happening?

4562
04:43:06,840 --> 04:43:08,400
You have to do it from launch options.

4563
04:43:09,200 --> 04:43:10,880
Okay, I'm gonna write launch options.

4564
04:43:14,560 --> 04:43:15,960
Quickly, can you give me the command?

4565
04:43:19,240 --> 04:43:20,240
Because I can do that right now.

4566
04:43:23,970 --> 04:43:24,670
Let me see here.

4567
04:43:24,810 --> 04:43:25,490
Launch options.

4568
04:43:27,590 --> 04:43:28,630
Send me the message on Discord.

4569
04:43:28,730 --> 04:43:29,270
Yeah, that's great.

4570
04:43:29,370 --> 04:43:30,030
Send it on Discord.

4571
04:43:30,130 --> 04:43:30,570
That's perfect.

4572
04:43:32,910 --> 04:43:34,790
Okay, but guys, I actually wasn't lying before.

4573
04:43:34,930 --> 04:43:35,730
I need to eat.

4574
04:43:35,870 --> 04:43:37,150
I need to eat something.

4575
04:43:37,970 --> 04:43:39,310
My stomach has been rumbling.

4576
04:43:39,470 --> 04:43:41,710
I always wonder if that is picked up by the mic.

4577
04:43:41,790 --> 04:43:42,550
I don't think it is.

4578
04:43:43,030 --> 04:43:49,990
Because I do have a noise gate on it, so... Guys, goddammit, thank you for watching today.

4579
04:43:50,070 --> 04:43:51,830
That was a stream, huh?

4580
04:43:52,840 --> 04:43:53,820
Discovered some new shit.

4581
04:43:54,400 --> 04:43:55,480
Recovered my old shit.

4582
04:43:56,740 --> 04:43:57,900
And did a bunch of things.

4583
04:43:58,140 --> 04:44:00,040
And also a bunch of not-so-great things.

4584
04:44:00,180 --> 04:44:00,560
But I did it.

4585
04:44:01,060 --> 04:44:02,120
And all of you are amazing.

4586
04:44:02,320 --> 04:44:04,200
I see all of you subbing, by the way, here.

4587
04:44:04,500 --> 04:44:05,980
