4588
04:44:07,960 --> 04:44:08,340
Frank!

4589
04:44:09,780 --> 04:44:15,920
Got an... Got an... Got an end immediately as the sub ran... Oh, you got an ad immediately as the sub ran out.

4590
04:44:17,440 --> 04:44:18,400
