4591
04:44:18,720 --> 04:44:19,700
Okay, it's running out.

4592
04:44:19,840 --> 04:44:20,300
Five seconds.

4593
04:44:20,520 --> 04:44:20,660
Four.

4594
04:44:21,000 --> 04:44:22,980
Three, two... Hit him with the ad!

4595
04:44:23,300 --> 04:44:24,120
Do it now!

4596
04:44:26,580 --> 04:44:27,900
That's actually kind of funny.

4597
04:44:29,220 --> 04:44:31,160
I'm sorry about that, but, uh, yep.

4598
04:44:32,060 --> 04:44:39,860
Thank you all for watching, subbing, and just enjoying me struggling and having fun in Minecraft and other games.

4599
04:44:40,240 --> 04:44:41,060
You're the best.

4600
04:44:41,720 --> 04:44:44,020
And don't forget, enjoy this weekend, okay?

4601
04:44:44,260 --> 04:44:45,380
It may be the last.

4602
04:44:48,120 --> 04:44:48,980
I'll see you around.

4603
04:44:49,770 --> 04:44:50,810
Good night!
